        <Dialogs>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Huh, where am I？ It's all
white.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>......</Dialog>
          <Dialog>　　　　　　　・ 　　　　　　　・ 　　　　　　　・</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...It's starting to become a
little clearer.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Huh!?
▲小早川＊▲!?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What's she doing here...？
Oh, I get it, this is a
dream.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Since it's a dream, maybe she
won't get angry if I touch
her.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>All right. I'll try touching
her.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>？！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...That surprised me. She
reacts even in a dream.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...I wonder if I could touch
her a little more.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Seems like she's happy.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...She doesn't like it. So
sometimes it's a no.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>It looks like she's really
enjoying it.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Kobayakawa</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Someone's gonna see us...？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her responses are different
depending on where I touch
her.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Depending on her mood, some
places will be good to touch,
and some bad.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Looks like the number of times
I can touch her depends on her
mood, too.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Where can I touch her？ I
guess I'll give it a go.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her hair... A boyfriend's
privilege.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her forehead... That's kind
of cute.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her ear... I wonder if she's
ticklish.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her body... I have to be
careful with this.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her arm... It would be good if
we could walk arm in arm.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her hand... I want to hold
hands, too.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Apparently, this won't do.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her hair, forehead, ear, body,
arm, and hand. That's about
all.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Hm？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Ah, the world is turning white
again... Is it over already？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Just a bit more...
▲小早川＊▲,
wait！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Huh？ Where am I？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I see, a dream. Still, that
was a really vivid dream.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>But I can't settle for a
dream.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>All right, I'll do it right
on our next date！</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
      </SDL2>
