        <Dialogs>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What is this place？ There's
no one here...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...What？ It's all suddenly
turning white.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>That's right. I feel like I've
had this dream before...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Whoa！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>▲小早川＊▲
is this close...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>And the mood's kind of nice,
too.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>......</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Maybe I can kiss her？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Last time I could only tap.
This time I'll try stroking.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her reactions change a bit
depending on how I touch
her.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>All right, this time I will
try her cheek.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Whoa, she doesn't want me
to touch there.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I think it would be best not
to do that.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'll try touching her a little
longer.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>So she likes it when I keep
it up longer.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Depending on where I touch
her, her expression will
change from time to time.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I wonder where I can touch.
Guess I'll just try.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her head... Looks like I can
pat it.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her forehead... Looks like I
can touch it.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her cheek... I can touch here
as well.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her shoulders... This seems
okay too.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Not the right place...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Whoa, better not do that.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her head, forehead, cheek, and
shoulder... I think I've got
it.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Hm？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Something's different...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Whoa!?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>This is...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'm allowed to kiss her after
all？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Even if it's a dream, is
this okay...？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>But if I think of it as
practice, it's fine, right？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Well, what now？ Lips are the
first thing you think of when
kissing, right？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I think I can kiss her
forehead, cheek, or near her
mouth.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>All right, let's try it.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>A light kiss on the cheek
seems best.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Kissing her forehead... This
looks okay.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Around her mouth... A light
kiss seems best.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>A light kiss on the lips
works too, huh.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Except for her lips, I
can't kiss for very long.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...This is no good.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I got a little carried
away...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Okay, let me collect myself
and try again.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I just have to keep my lips
on hers...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Even though it's a dream,
I'm starting to feel
strange...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>It has to be longer...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>No, no, I have to kiss her
lips.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>This is no good.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Phew...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Having a dream like this...
Am I frustrated or
something？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Way too embarrassing to tell
▲小早川＊▲
about this.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Ah, everything is going white
again... Is it over？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I wish I could stay, but I
guess it's just a dream, after
all...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>After a dream like this,
I can't face
▲小早川＊▲...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>No, I just need to be able
to do it for real, not in a
dream.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>All right！ I'll try my best
on my next date.</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
